|term[preferred-location] :status settled :defined-by def-entities-values-promises :anchor the-four-promises
  :word preferred-location
  The promise "this resolves today, and it's the one we'd rather you use."
  |invariants
    - Is a canonicity promise, mutually exclusive: [[term/true-identity]] | [[term/canonical-location]] | [[term/preferred-location]] | [[term/working-path]]
    - (pending [[DECISIONS#d11-universal-path|D11 universal-path]]) Is a kind of [[term/universal-path]]
    - May be superseded without breach
